EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello,

I am reaching out to you from National Funding, the broker on your loan with {!Case.Lender_Account_Name__c}.

They notified us of a recent return on the contract and we are following up to ensure funds will be available for them to rerun and continue regular payments.

If you have any questions, please reach out to their customer service line: XXX-XXX-XXXX


Thank you,

{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}
E: {!User.Email}
